# Frappe Education — Reference Baseline

**Repo:** https://github.com/frappe/education (AGPL-3.0, v16.0.1 as of May 2026, ~524 stars).

## Built-in modules

- Student & Course Management (admission forms, batch creation, bulk admissions)
- Fee Management (flexible structures, Razorpay)
- Class Management (instructor assignment, scheduling, attendance)
- Assessment Tool (exams, grading, auto-grade)
- Student Portal (courses, timetable, grades, leave, attendance, fee payment)

## Hosting

Self-host via bench (`bench get-app education && bench install-app education`) or Frappe Cloud Marketplace. Docs at frappe.github.io/schools (legacy) and the README.

## Related Frappe apps to combine

- `frappe/erpnext` — HR, Accounts, Stock (Library/Inventory), Transport-like vehicle tracking
- `frappe/lms` — separate LMS app (github.com/frappe/lms)
- `frappe/hrms` — HR/Payroll (split from ERPNext)
- `frappe/builder` / `frappe/insights` — page builder & analytics dashboards

## How to apply

- When the PDF requirement matches a built-in capability, **use it as-is**.
- When it doesn't (franchise hierarchy, MY School ID format, monitoring/inspection), add custom DocTypes in our own `myschools` app rather than forking education.
